#Display string for package name
#子系统名称，key值iMAP_CorbaAgent为子系统描述文件中定义的子系统名称
NML_VLAN=Nativeeth Service Management 
#子系统的安装信息描述
NML_VLAN.InstallInfo = Provides the Native Ethernet service management function, which helps to quickly configure or maintain microware Ethernet services. After the service access interface is specified, the U2000 automatically calculates routes and creates the service on NEs. 